  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"281\" data-end=\"320\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"318\">About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"752\">Purelab Care is a global halal skincare movement redefining luxury through science, ethics, and transparency. Our award-winning formulations are developed through two years of international R&amp;D and third-party testing with SGS and Intertek. Each product — from our Hydrating Serums to our Mineral Sunscreens — embodies <strong data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"691\">halal-certified, vegan, and cruelty-free beauty</strong> designed to deliver clinical-level results with integrity.</p><p data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"946\">Our mission, <em data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"818\">“Crafting Ethical Beauty to Empower Generations,”</em> goes beyond skincare — we aim to uplift communities and redefine <em data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"891\">halal</em> as a universal gold standard for wellness and trust.</p><hr data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\"><h3 data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"987\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"985\">What makes us different:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1459\">Unlike typical skincare brands, Purelab Care is built on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1095\">radical transparency and scientific validation</strong>.<br data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1099\">✅ Certified by global halal councils (including JAKIM, Malaysia)<br data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1166\">✅ Clinically tested in world-class labs like SGS &amp; Intertek<br data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1228\">✅ Formulated with active ingredients found in prestige brands like La Mer &amp; Lancôme — but ethically made<br data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\">✅ Backed by the SĀNI™ Certified standard — our internal mark of excellence<br data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1412\">✅ Proudly Malaysian-made and globally trusted</p><p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1601\">We’re not just a brand — we’re building a <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1534\">movement for ethical beauty</strong> led by empowered creators, dermatologists, and community voices.</p><hr data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1606\"><h3 data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1642\"><strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1640\">How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1909\">Affiliates receive up to&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1686\">10% commission</strong> on every sale through their unique link or discount code.<br data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1747\">Plus, exclusive rewards and milestone prizes — from <strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1841\">free luxury skincare sets (worth $450)</strong> to <strong data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1876\">cash bonuses up to $250,000</strong> — for top-performing partners.</p><p data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2062\">💎 Average product value: USD $160–$295<br data-start=\"1950\" data-end=\"1953\">💎 Global shipping and fulfillment handled by Purelab<br data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2009\">💎 Monthly performance-based prizes for top sellers</p><hr data-start=\"2064\" data-end=\"2067\"><h3 data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2097\"><strong data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2095\">How to promote us:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2170\">You can promote Purelab Care in ways that fit your style and audience:</p><ul data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2571\"><li data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2242\"><p data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2242\">Share your <strong data-start=\"2184\" data-end=\"2204\">skincare journey</strong> or before-and-after transformations</p></li><li data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2320\"><p data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2320\">Create <strong data-start=\"2252\" data-end=\"2285\">UGC videos or product reviews</strong> on TikTok, Instagram, or YouTube</p></li><li data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2389\"><p data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2389\">Host <strong data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2358\">giveaways or live sessions</strong> featuring your discount code</p></li><li data-start=\"2390\" data-end=\"2468\"><p data-start=\"2392\" data-end=\"2468\">Recommend products through <strong data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2466\">blogs, skincare guides, or community groups</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2571\"><p data-start=\"2471\" data-end=\"2571\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2569\">beauty creators, skincare enthusiasts, event hosts, and Muslim lifestyle influencers</strong></p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2713\">We provide you with content assets, product education, and exclusive access to new launches so your promotion feels authentic and premium.</p><hr data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2718\"><h3 data-start=\"2720\" data-end=\"2748\"><strong data-start=\"2724\" data-end=\"2746\">Other information:</strong></h3><p data-start=\"2749\" data-end=\"3056\">🌍 Open to affiliates worldwide (priority for USA, Malaysia, Singapore, and GCC countries)<br data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2842\">🎁 Free product bundles for select affiliates to review and feature<br data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2912\">💬 Dedicated affiliate support team to help you grow your channel and earnings<br data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\">💰 Monthly payouts and performance tracking through UpPromote</p><p data-start=\"3058\" data-end=\"3185\">Join the movement redefining beauty — <strong data-start=\"3096\" data-end=\"3121\">Halal as a Lifestyle.</strong><br data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3124\">Be part of the next generation of ethical, luxury skincare.</p></div></div>",
